OL,3,GNEWSACancer survivor hopes surf camp
OL,4,Awill change lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FA double cancer survivor has credited
OL,7,Fsurfing with helping him rediscover his
OL,8,Fidentity after life-changing surgery.
OL,10,FStephen Downes lost his left arm,
OL,11,Fshoulder, collarbone, three ribs and
OL,12,Fpart of his chest wall during surgery
OL,13,Ffor myxofibrosarcoma, a rare form of
OL,14,Fsoft tissue cancer, in 2022.
OL,16,FBut he was determined to return to the
OL,17,Fsport he loved and went on to become
OL,18,Ftwo-time English kneeboard surfing
OL,19,Fchampion.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
