OL,3,GNEWSACancer survivor hopes surf camp
OL,4,Awill change lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FDownes, from Newquay in Cornwall, said
OL,7,Fhe felt "a moral obligation to give
OL,8,Fback" and set up The Dawn Patrol
OL,9,FProject surf camp held in Bristol to
OL,10,Fbring together other people suffering
OL,11,Ffrom sarcoma cancers.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
